          "value": "For the given vector ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/assets/4d6fc79d41790b29a966f7a3303329ab1b778856991ad5b3b85ee3965fce2e33.png) we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =[\\begin{aligned}-3+7\\text{i} \\\\ 5-2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{\\text{Re}(x)}+\\text{i}\\,{{[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{\\text{Im}(x)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore $a=-3, b=5, c=7$ and $d=-2,$ which implies that\n\n$$\nab+cd=(-3) \\cdot 5 + 7 \\cdot (-2) = -29.\n$$",
