      "old_sha256": "9259e20ea9b60969f6cca6080714d86f8280cab94bfb14d4a36bf0c037d4c347",
      "new_sha256": "26b8bd5d2eb7a6530d4b2ab4d9fbb2d52b0373c4a82bf8d68ae6a41d91e0291d",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-7345",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Since $\\overline{k\\mathbf{v}} = \\overline{k} \\, \\overline{\\mathbf{v}},$ we get the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{kv} & =\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\,\\overset{\u2015}{v} \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}8\\text{i}-12 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\,\\overset{\u2015}{[\\begin{aligned}-4\\text{i} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]} \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}8\\text{i}-12 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\,[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{-4\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{\u2015}{0}\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}8\\text{i}-12 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\,[\\begin{aligned}4\\text{i} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}8\\text{i}-12 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}4\\text{i}\\,\\overset{\u2015}{k} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain that \n\n$$\n4\\textrm{i}\\,\\overline{k}  = 8\\textrm{i}-12\n\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\qquad\n\\overline{k}=\\dfrac{8\\textrm{i}-12}{4\\textrm i} = 2+3\\textrm{i}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, $k=\\overline{2+3\\textrm{i}}=2-3\\textrm{i}.$\n\nFinally, $\\textrm{Im}(k)=-3.$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/example-7345.json",
          "file_sha256": "9bdacf852e90fc6d990eb01fc7d446694c93372c72f166e292506d111d2bc630"
        }
